    "A": "$\\{a_n\\}$ converges to $1$;",
    "B": "$\\{a_n\\}$ converges to $0$;",
    "C": "$\\{a_n\\}$ converges to $1/2$;",
    "D": "$\\{a_n\\}$ converges to $1/\\sqrt2$."
  },
  "answer": "B",
